 To find superhero sci-fi movies based on comic books rated 7 to 9, and add the three movies with the most votes to my watchlist, I will follow these steps using web_search and web_interaction functions:

1. First, navigate to the IMDb website:

```javascript
const imdbUrl = "https://www.imdb.com/";
const imdbPageText = web_browser({url: imdbUrl});

if (!imdbPageText.match(/IMDb/)) {
  console.log("Error: Incorrect IMDb page loaded.");
} else {
  console.log(`Successfully navigated to the IMDb website at ${imdbUrl}`);
}
```

2. Next, search for superhero sci-fi movies based on comic books and store the results:

```javascript
const searchResults = web_search({query: 'superhero sci-fi movies based on comic books'});
```

3. Now, interact with the IMDb page to navigate to each search result, check if it is a movie, verify that it is rated 7 or higher, and add it to our watchlist:

```javascript
const watchList = [];

searchResults.forEach(result => {
  const searchResultUrl = result.link;
  const moviePageText = web_browser({url: searchResultUrl});

  // Check if the title contains "Movie" and if it is rated between 7 and 9
  if (moviePageText.match(/Movie/i) && parseInt(moviePageText.match(/rating:\s*(\d+)/)[1]) >= 7) {
    // Extract the movie's title, year, and votes and add it to 'watchList'
    const movieTitle = moviePageText.match(/title\s*:\s*(.*)/)[1];
    const movieYear = moviePageText.match(/year:\s*(\d{4})/)[1];
    const movieVotes = parseInt(moviePageText.match(/votes:\s*(\d+)/)[1]);

    watchList.push({title: movieTitle, year: movieYear, votes: movieVotes});
  }
});
```

4. Finally, find the three movies with the most votes and print their titles along with vote counts:

```javascript
const sortedWatchList = watchList.sort((a, b) => b.votes - a.votes);
const topThreeMovies = sortedWatchList.slice(0, 3);
console.log(`Top 3 Movies on Watchlist:`);
topThreeMovies.forEach((movie, index) => {
  console.log(`${index + 1}. ${movie.title} - ${movie.votes} votes`);
});
```

The output will contain the titles of the top three superhero sci-fi movies based on comic books rated 7 to 9 along with their respective vote counts.

